🫦 Togetherly • v1.30.0

— Togetherly+ can now be bought right on iPhone
— Love test: 80 statements instead of 20, a fresh set each time, and a comparison with last time
— Custom "Miss you" wishes survive a reinstall
— Watch together: you get into the room right after the ad, not two minutes later
— The watch room now fits every screen — the link field is finally visible
— A memory deleted by your partner disappears on the second phone too
— Plus is no longer offered to people who already have it
— Drawings are editable now: pick a shape with your finger, move it, rotate it, pull its edges
— A canvas tile shows the drawing right away, no need to open it first
— Pixel mode draws shapes with cells instead of smooth lines
— The vessel takes a week, a month or a year, and its blocks now show talks, memories by kind and the cycle
— People with Plus are no longer promised an ad in the watch room
